      howToRun: 'Read Genesis 32:7-8 and ask what Jacob could and could not control; hold the room there until somebody says it. Then read 32:10 and ask what changes about the split once you hear him call it mercy. Take James 4:14 and have someone read only the ground clause aloud, then 4:15 for what to say instead. Spend the last third on the perimeter list, done live on a board, with the group naming assets until the one-perimeter problem is visible to everyone. End by having each person say out loud the single blank they will fill this week — one row each, named, and nothing longer.',
