      'You get the question moved off your temperament. Fear buys badly and pride refuses to look; Scripture files this under provision, which is a duty: "But if any provide not for his own, and specially for those of his own house, he hath denied the faith, and is worse than an infidel." (1 Timothy 5:8)',
